cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Assay, please cite it."
title: "Assay: A Canary-Oracle Benchmark for MCP Security"
abstract: >-
  A frozen task set for Model Context Protocol (MCP) security, scored by a deterministic,
  recomputable HMAC-canary oracle at the tool boundary, structural-zero false positives for
  canary-gated tasks, in contrast to LLM-judge graders.
authors:
  - name: "The Assay Authors"
version: "0.1"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-06-10"
url: "https://github.com/VatsSShah/assay"
keywords: [MCP, benchmark, LLM security, agent security, red-team]
